  "question": {
    "text": "The range of the projectile projected at an angle of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>15</mn><mo>&#8728;</mo></msup></math> with horizontal is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>50</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math>. If the projectile is projected with same velocity at an angle of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>45</mn><mo>&#8728;</mo></msup></math> with horizontal, then its range will be"
  },
